@ 0 3 0 1f9549fa60e511ed0d3bff4c27911dbd
+ Die drei schreiben `{"by":"a bear","kind":"Pursued"}`, `{"Pursued":{"by":"a bear"}}` und
+ `{"type":"Pursued","value":{"by":"a bear"}}`. [Getaggte
+ Unions](../../soundness/modules/json.md#tagged-unions) beschreibt jede Konvention.
